# What's New's membership line in Japanese and Chinese: drawn from the UI font (the cards' own fonts are Latin only), so no "?"
# boxes (glyphs_missing). The id suffixes stay the same in every language (tests/ui/whats_new_member_note.sfui is the English one).
env SF_WHATS_NEW_VERSION 0.12.0
run ui_look look=classic layout=classic
run new_sphere subdivisions=3
click "Preferences##palette.preferences"
click "Interface##preferences.interface"
click "日本語##language.ja"
expect "ヘルプ##palette.help"
member_card appeal starts=2
click "ヘルプ##palette.help"
click "新機能##help.whats_new"
wait 0.5
expect_value whats_new_note == 1
expect_text SculptForge は無料
expect_value glyphs_missing == 0
shot whats-new-member-note-ja
click "Close##whats_new"
wait 0.4
expect_value whats_new_open == 0
